Package: econcompare
Type: Package
Title: OLS-Reference Econometric Model Comparison and Viewer
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person("econcompare", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.com")
Description: A beta research-software toolkit for estimating and comparing cross-sectional
    econometric models against an ordinary least squares reference. It provides a
    programmatic interface, a lightweight HTML viewer, and an interactive Shiny
    workspace for configuring estimators and inspecting coefficients, fit statistics,
    diagnostics, and warnings. The current scope includes weighted and robust linear
    estimation, instrumental variables, quantile regression, censored regression, and
    sample-selection models. Missing or length-zero fit statistics are handled
    explicitly rather than causing viewer failures.
